<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55553" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφρύγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burn away, burn to ashes</i>, of lightning, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				396
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of love, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				14.26
			</span></i> (Pap. ined.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>parch</i>, <i>consume</i>, of disease, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				<u>Febr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be dried up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶσσαι καταπεφρυγμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				5.95
			</span></i>: fut. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρυγήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφρον-φρύσ&lt;σ&gt;ω</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφρον-φρύττω</span></b> , Id., <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				299.11
			</span></i>.</div>
